  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞似乎是死路……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e725_460.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 03 01 06 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 6B 03}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}什么嘛，死路啊。\n白跑一趟了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e725_460.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 3F 06}不……\n至少我们知道了，\n“这里是一条什么也没有的死路”……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e725_460.bf.json:2:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}绝不是白跑。\n这是很重要的一步。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e725_460.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 07 01 07 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 D8 07}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}哦——真积极。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e725_460.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 84 08}……不过，还真是什么都没有啊。\n塔尔塔罗斯里至少还有宝箱呢。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e725_460.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 07 01 01 01 01 01 F5 02}{F5 86 0F 01 0D 01 65 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}这次不是单独行动，\n没法把东西据为己有了呢。\n顺平。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e725_460.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 88 08}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}我才不会呢。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e725_460.bf.json:6:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 05 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 86 08}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}……不对，“这次”是什么意思！？\n说得我平时都会一样……喂，风花！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e725_460.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 12 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 A9 0C}汪！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e725_460.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 10 01 0D 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}虎狼丸先生说，这次没问题。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
